id: fairy
name: Fairy
order: 3
category: body
# A Factor Trait replaces a Secondary Racial Trait - Secondary, then, unless it names a Primary one to replace.
importance: secondary
# (1)
choose: list
choices: Nano, Tiny, Small
# (3), (4)
grantsOther: bestial, monstrous
grantsOtherFrom: winged-beast, unique-monstrosity
description: >
  A spirit of nature, your pointed ears and gossamer wings mark you as a powerful trickster.
text: >
  Fairy (Body): A spirit of nature, your pointed ears and gossamer wings mark you as a powerful trickster.
  (1)-[Passive]: Upon gaining this Factor Trait, select a Size Category (Nano/Tiny/Small). That becomes your base Size Category.
  (2)-[Passive]: Upon gaining this Factor Trait, gain a Skill Improvement.
  (3)-[Passive]: You gain access to the Winged Beast Bestial Trait.
  (4)-[Passive]: You gain access to the Unique Monstrosity Monstrous Trait.
  (5)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you make a Skill Clash, increase the Dice Score of that Clash by 2.
  (6)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you make a Clash that uses your Saving Throws, increase the Dice Score of that Clash by 1(T).

---

# (2) The Skill Improvement: the table's, on the Progression tab. (3), (4) Its headers - in the Other Traits list, gained with it.
[passive]
# (1) The Size chosen is the one they are built as (actor-character.mjs).
allow size.base.$choice;
# (5), (6) A box in the Clash's window, each once a Round: a Skill Clash 2, a Saving Throw's 1(T) (chat.mjs fairyClashOpen).
allow fairy.skill;
allow fairy.save;
